OL,3,GNEWSAFormer chef 'humbled' to be BBC
OL,4,Aaward winner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Michelin-starred chef who has
OL,7,Fraised more than #170,000 for three
OL,8,Fcharities said he was "overwhelmed" and
OL,9,F"humbled" to be recognised at the BBC
OL,10,FRadio Stoke Make A Difference Awards
OL,11,Fthis year.
OL,13,FMatt Davies was among eight winners on
OL,14,Fthe night, and topped the fundraising
OL,15,Fcategory.
OL,17,F"I don't think it's really settled in,"
OL,18,Fhe said.
